{"name":"Creamy cauliflower cheese with walnuts","permalink":"creamy-cauliflower-cheese","edit":"https://github.com/The-Silverwood-Institute/Recibase/tree/master/src/main/scala/se/reciba/api/recibase/recipes/CreamyCauliflowerCheeseWalnuts.scala","source":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1A0bgFOwirLW2mct8KNrxYdk4OEsGZtY23mFdgOljHFA","description":null,"tagline":null,"notes":[],"dated_notes":[],"tags":["Vegetarian","Quick","Low Effort"],"inherited_tags":["Pescatarian","Vegetarian-ish"],"image":null,"ingredients_blocks":[{"name":null,"ingredients":[{"name":"Cauliflower","quantity":"1","prep":"cut into 1cm pieces","notes":null},{"name":"Creme Fraiche","quantity":"300g","prep":null,"notes":"or Cream Cheese"},{"name":"Dijon Mustard","quantity":"1 tsp","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Blue Cheese","quantity":"125g","prep":"crumbled","notes":null},{"name":"Walnuts","quantity":"25g","prep":"roughly chopped","notes":null},{"name":"Cheddar Cheese","quantity":"50g","prep":"grated","notes":null},{"name":"Salt","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Black pepper","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null}]}],"method":["Steam the cauliflower until tender, drain, then place in a grill-suitable dish","Mix the cream cheese and mustard with the cauliflower, then stir in the blue cheese. Season with a little salt if necessary and plenty of pepper.","Scatter the walnuts on top, then cover with the cheddar (this helps to prevent the walnuts from burning).","Place under a preheated hot grill for 10-15 minutes, or until the top is golden brown and the inside hot and bubbling."]}